# lines N bytes M -- PROGRAM: the lines of the source of a program, and
# the bytes of it as built, stripped, as the sizes group of test/run.sh
# found them the first time; lib is the library of the programs, its
# lines alone.  Either may grow by 2 percent: more fails it.
margin lines 1.02 bytes 1.02
